<h1 data-nh-numbering=3D"2. " id=3D"FSDTMPInputVATAPIIntegrationwithTitanPI=
-Glossary"><span class=3D"nh-number">2. </span>Glossary</h1>
<p><span style=3D"color:#172b4d;">For the full glossary of Titan terms the =
central glossary is maintained<span>&nbsp;</span></span><a class=3D"externa=
l-link" style=3D"text-align: left;" href=3D"https://pulse.trafigura.com/wor=
kspaces/titan/_layouts/15/WopiFrame.aspx?sourcedoc=3D/workspaces/titan/Tita=
n%20Releases%20Documents/Titan%20Glossary.xlsx" rel=3D"nofollow">here</a><s=
pan style=3D"color:#172b4d;">.</span></p>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
 <table class=3D"relative-table wrapped confluenceTable" style=3D"width: 98=
.404%;">
  <colgroup>
   <col style=3D"width: 11.8631%;">
   <col style=3D"width: 88.1369%;">
  </colgroup>
  <tbody class=3D"">
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p><strong>Term</strong></p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p><strong>Definition</strong></p></td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>VAT Invoice</p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>This is a China specific term. A Value-Added Tax (VAT) invoice is a=
 document issued by an accountable entity. A VAT invoice sets out the detai=
ls of a taxable supply and all related information as prescribed by VAT law=
. In the context of this document ,this is to mention the Golden tax VAT in=
voice verified with China Golden tax system.</p></td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Special VAT Invoice</p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>This is a China specific term. Special VAT Invoices are issued by T=
rafigura to its counterparty when selling commodities or providing taxable =
services. The Special VAT invoices are used for VAT deduction purposes. Tra=
figura also receives Special VAT invoice from counterparty for purchase tra=
des.</p></td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>General VAT Invoice</p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>This is a China specific term. General VAT invoices cannot be used =
for VAT deduction purposes. General&nbsp; VAT Invoices are issued by Trafig=
ura to its counterparty when selling commodities or providing tax services.=
 Trafigura also receives General VAT invoice for counterparty for purchase =
trades.</p></td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>VAT Invoice Number</p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>This is a China specific term. The golden tax invoice number approv=
ed/ generated by Golden Tax system.</p></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Commercial Invoice</p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>A seller-issued invoice that provides detailed information about go=
ods or services sold to a buyer and is used for customs declaration, tax as=
sessment, and international trade settlement. It serves as a commercial and=
 shipping document supporting domestic and cross-border trade transactions.=
 It is also called international invoice in Titan.</p></td>
   </tr>
  </tbody>
 </table>
</div>
<h1 data-nh-numbering=3D"3. " id=3D"FSDTMPInputVATAPIIntegrationwithTitanPI=
-Scope"><span class=3D"nh-number">3. </span>Scope</h1>
<h2 data-nh-numbering=3D"3.1. " id=3D"FSDTMPInputVATAPIIntegrationwithTitan=
PI-InScope"><span class=3D"nh-number">3.1. </span><span class=3D"nh-number"=
><span> </span></span>In Scope</h2>
<ul>
 <li>GC incorporated in China</li>
 <li>Business Line: RM, Bulk, Concs.</li>
 <li>Trading VAT invoices, including Cargo &amp; Service invoices</li>
 <li data-uuid=3D"a9921f2b-9ae7-4046-bd4e-d51d61bf3f42">Customs VAT payment=
 receipt, Customs duty payment receipt, Withholding tax payment receipt</li=
>
 <li>Both IC VAT and non-IC VAT are in scope</li>
 <li>Blue VAT invoice and red VAT invoice (normal PI &amp; CN)</li>
 <li><span style=3D"color:#f87168;"><span style=3D"color:#172b4d;">China In=
ternational =EF=BC=88Commercial=EF=BC=89 invoice</span></span></li>
</ul>
<h2 data-nh-numbering=3D"3.2. " id=3D"FSDTMPInputVATAPIIntegrationwithTitan=
PI-OutofScope"><span class=3D"nh-number">3.2. </span>Out of Scope</h2>
<ul>
 <li>GC not incorporated in China</li>
 <li>Business Line: Energy</li>
 <li>non-Trading invoices</li>
</ul>
<h1 data-nh-numbering=3D"4. " id=3D"FSDTMPInputVATAPIIntegrationwithTitanPI=
