     <p>27.R2</p></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">FR-02</td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td"><span style=3D"color:#000000;">Customs VAT &amp; duty invoices</span></=
td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <p>As an ST user, I need Titan PI to auto synchronize below informatio=
n of China Customs VAT &amp; Duty invoices Credit Note to TMP on daily basi=
s when CN get approved, so that I don't need to manually unlink Titan PI No=
. with Customs payment receipt in TMP.</p>
     <p>Information required: Titan PI No., CP Invoice Ref., <s>Account per=
iod</s>, Description, Underlying PI No.</p>
     <p>Criteria: Status=3D'Approved', TMP status &lt;&gt;'Success' (meanin=
g not booked in TMP yet)</p></td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <p>Titan PI</p></td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <p>27.R2</p></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">FR-03</td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td"><span style=3D"color:#000000;">Customs VAT &amp; duty invoices</span></=
td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <p>As an ST user, I need TMP to auto sync. Titan PI No. based on the C=
P. invoice Ref.&nbsp; and PI description upon receive Titan PI message of t=
he same, so that I don't need to manually input the same in TMP.</p>
     <p>Notes: For Titan PI-Customs Payment receipt 1-1 case, ST will input=
 customs VAT or duty payment receipt No. in CP Invoice Ref, for 1-N case, S=
T&nbsp;will input in Description field with multiple customs VAT or duty pa=
yment receipt No. with semicolon separated.</p></td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <p>TMP</p></td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <p>27.R2</p></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">FR-04</td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td"><span style=3D"color:#000000;">Customs VAT &amp; duty invoices</span></=
td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">As an ST user, I need TMP to auto clear Titan PI No. based on the CP. i=
nvoice Ref.&nbsp; and PI description, untick customs VAT if already ticked =
(as in reality customs VAT does not have red invoice), upon receive Titan C=
N on the same, so that I don't need to manually clear the same in TMP.&nbsp=
;</td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <p>TMP</p></td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <p>27.R2</p></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">FR-05</td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td"><span style=3D"color:#000000;">Customs VAT</span></td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">As a mailroom user, I need TMP to auto untick Customs VAT upon receive =
Titan CN if previously ticked, so to avoid wrong input VAT ticking.</td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <p>TMP</p></td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <p>27.R2</p></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">FR-06</td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td"><span style=3D"color:#000000;">Customs VAT &amp; duty invoices</span></=
td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">As an ST user, I need TMP to inform me if Titan PI sends another PI No.=
 on the same Customs VAT &amp; Duty invoice which is already synchronized w=
ith Titan PI No. to avoid duplicated booking &amp; payment.</td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <p>TMP</p></td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <p>27.R2</p></td>
   </tr>
   <tr class=3D"">
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">FR-07</td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <p><span style=3D"color:#000000;">General VAT invoice</span></p></td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
      <p>General VAT invoice with tax amount should be interfaced to Titan =
PI in the API as below, due to General VAT tax is irrecoverable and Oracle =
does not support 'IRR' tax code.</p>
      <ul>
       <li data-uuid=3D"054ba330-40f1-49f0-a7af-5c43119d5b67">If the input =
VAT is not deductible (i.e. 6% Service General VAT), the tax status should =
be interfaced to Titan PI as =E2=80=98Outside scope=E2=80=99 &amp; tax code=
 =E2=80=98CN099PI=E2=80=99.</li>
      </ul>
      <ul>
       <li data-uuid=3D"3a1eb8b9-592a-4a5b-8ca4-c157ba33968d">If the tax is=
 exempted (e.g. Gold), the tax status should be interfaced to Titan PI as =
=E2=80=98Applicable=E2=80=99 &amp; tax code =E2=80=98CN205PI=E2=80=99.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>Tax amount to be consolidated into net amount and pass to Titan ne=
t amount,</p>
      <p>Tax amount pass to Titan as 0.</p>
      <p>Notes:</p>
      <p><span style=3D"color:#000000;"><span style=3D"color:#172b4d;">Gene=
ral VAT whose VAT is irrecoverable, there will be a break between TMP and O=
racle in tax amount reconciliation, but total invoice amount reconciliation=
 is balanced.</span></span></p>
      <p>PRD. Sample:</p>
      <p>Service General VAT with 6% tax rate: Tax Status-Outside Scope, Ta=
x Code: CN099PI</p>
