    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <p>TMP</p></td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <p>27.R1</p></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">FR-08</td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <p><span style=3D"color:#000000;">IC VAT invoice</span></p></td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
      <p>Previously IC VAT invoice will not be extracted to Titan PI feed, =
in API, IC invoice should also be covered since it is not necessary to be t=
riggered by SI to follow the internal invoicing approving process.</p>
      <p>If CP is also China GC, mark internal invoice as 'Yes'.</p>
     </div></td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <p>TMP,</p>
     <p>Titan PI</p>
     <p>CCEP-194525</p></td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <p>27.R2</p></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">FR-09</td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <p><span style=3D"color:#000000;">IC VAT invoice</span></p></td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
      <p>Internal purchase VAT invoice will only be interfaced to Titan PI =
after internal Titan SI issued successfully, so that TMP will interface Tit=
an SI number to Titan PI as CP invoice reference for IC invoices.</p>
     </div></td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <p>TMP, Titan PI</p></td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <p>27.R2</p></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">FR-10</td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <p><span style=3D"color:#000000;">IC VAT invoice</span></p></td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
      <p>After internal PI booked, PI No. should be sent to Titan SI to boo=
k the internal invoice number.</p>
     </div></td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <p>Titan PI, Titan SI</p></td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <p>27.R2</p></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">FR-11</td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <p><span style=3D"color:#000000;">Service VAT attribution</span></p></=
td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <p>TMP to synchronize RM service cost group from WDMS and support user=
 to do service VAT attribution in TMP by uploading attribution lines, so th=
at TMP can interface the same to Titan PI at day end batch job. For invoice=
s with attribution, the invoice will get auto attributed and approved in Ti=
tan PI.</p></td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <p>WDMS,</p>
     <p>TMP,</p>
     <p>Titan PI</p>
     <p>CCEP-192145</p></td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <p>TBD</p></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">FR-12</td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <p><span style=3D"color:#000000;">Service VAT without attribution</spa=
n></p></td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <p>For service VAT without attribution, only those confirmed to be boo=
ked by user will be interfaced to Titan PI as Incomplete status and then us=
er will do further attribution and approval in Titan PI. The information fr=
om TMP should not allow user modification so to make sure it's the same fro=
m TMP.</p></td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <p>TMP,</p>
     <p>Titan PI</p>
     <p>CCEP-192145</p></td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <p>27.R1</p></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">FR-13</td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <p><span style=3D"color:#000000;">Status Transition</span></p></td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <p>The status of the VAT invoices sent to Titan PI will be updated wit=
h Titan PI No. and status. Sent-&gt;Approved or failed or cancelled. For fa=
iled ones, error message should be shown for user to check.</p>
     <p><span style=3D"color:#172b4d;">TMP will add Titan PI number and Tit=
an PI status for each VAT invoice. After sending the VAT invoice to Titan P=
I, the status will be 'sent', Titan PI will response with current PI No. &a=
mp; Status (e.g. Awaiting external validation) to TMP.&nbsp; TMP will sched=
ule query at intervals (every 5 mins) to get the latest Titan PI status and=
 update the same in TMP (e.g. 'Approved' or 'external fail' or 'Cancelled' =
) For failed ones, the failed reason should also be presented for user to f=
urther check. For Cancelled ones, Titan PI No. in TMP should be shown as em=
pty and taken as not sent to Titan PI and should be re-sent if other criter=
ia met.</span></p></td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <p>TMP,</p>
     <p>Titan PI</p></td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <p>27.R1</p></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">FR-14</td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <p><span style=3D"color:#000000;">Failed PI</span></p></td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <p>As a TMP user who confirm the Input VAT to be booked in Titan PI, I=
 need to be notified for the '<span style=3D"color:#172b4d;">external fail<=
/span>' Titan PI timely with failure reason, so that I can take necessary a=
ctions timely and clear about the gap between TMP and Titan/Oracle.</p></td=
>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <p>TMP</p></td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <p>27.R1</p></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">FR-15</td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <p>Accounting Period</p></td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <p>As an Accounting user, I require TMP to derive the VAT ticking mont=
h from the invoice Accounting Period in Oracle, so that Input VAT Invoices =
are deducted in the correct reporting period, avoiding timing discrepancies=
 and ensuring compliance with China accounting and tax regulations.</p>
     <p>Note: Input VAT Confirmation</p>
     <p>A mandatory tax process in China whereby a company confirms eligibl=
e VAT invoices on the State Tax Administration platform before claiming Inp=
ut VAT credits. The confirmation must be performed in the correct tax perio=
d which is the same in GAI/Oracle. Therefore, TMP requires the Accounting P=
eriod determined in Titan PI to decide in which month the VAT invoice shoul=
d be included for deduction.</p></td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <p>TMP,</p>
     <p>Oracle</p></td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <p>27.R1</p></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">FR-16</td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <p><span style=3D"color:#172b4d;">Input VAT Confirmation</span></p></t=
d>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <p>TMP should block user from unticking (=E5=8F=96=E6=B6=88=E8=AE=A4=
=E8=AF=81) input VAT if Titan PI No. is not empty.</p></td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <p>TMP</p></td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <p>27.R1</p></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">FR-17</td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <p><span style=3D"color:#172b4d;">Report</span></p></td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <p>As an Accounting user, I require TMP to send a month-end and M+1 ex=
ception report of VAT invoices that have been accounted for in the financia=
l system (Titan PI No. not empty and not Credit Noted) but are not yet VAT-=
confirmed, so that unconfirmed input VAT invoices can be followed up prompt=
ly, minimizing the risk of missed VAT deductions and supporting tax complia=
nce.</p></td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <p>TMP</p></td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <p>27.R1</p></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">FR-18</td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <p><span style=3D"color:#000000;">Cargo Doc. L/C</span></p></td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <p>In cargo invoice attribution screen add a checkbox 'Cargo Doc LC'. =
If ticked, TMP will default LC amount=3Dinvoice net amount, LC Tax Amount=
=3Dinvoice tax amount, and allow user modification. The same will be interf=
aced to Titan PI.</p>
     <p>If PI amount fully covered by LC amount, 'DO NOT Pay' will be ticke=
d by Titan PI automatically. Otherwise only the amount not covered by LC wi=
ll be allowed to create PO.</p></td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <p>TMP,</p>
     <p>Titan PI</p></td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <p>27.R2</p></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">FR-19</td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <p><span style=3D"color:#000000;">Bulk invoice weight basis</span></p>=
</td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td"><span style=3D"color:#000000;">In cargo invoice attribution screen, add=
 field 'invoice weight basis' to record Bulk VAT invoice weight basis and p=
ass the same to Titan PI, Titan PI needs to use the same to do Qty validati=
on, i.e. if VAT invoice weight basis is Wet, use assignment Wet weight to v=
alidate invoiced weight, else use assignment Dry weight to do the validatio=
n. The remaining Qty calculation should be on the same invoice weight basis=
.</span></td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td"><span style=3D"color:#000000;"> </span>
     <p>TMP,</p>
     <p>Titan PI</p></td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <p>27.R2</p></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">FR-20</td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <p><span style=3D"color:#000000;">Bulk invoice weight basis</span></p>=
</td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">Titan PI should pass the Bulk invoice weight basis to BO, so that BO ca=
n show the correct invoiced weight and remaining to be invoiced weight in B=
ulk Settlement Note.</td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <p>Titan PI,</p>
     <p>Business Object</p></td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <p>27.R2</p></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">FR-21</td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <p><span style=3D"color:#000000;">Cargo Invoice filter</span></p></td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <p>Cargo invoice: Same as current Excel uploader <a href=3D"https://co=
nfluence/display/CLA/FSD+-TMP+Cargo+Input+VAT+invoice+attribution+feed+to+b=
e+uploaded+to+Titan+PI" rel=3D"nofollow">FSD -TMP Cargo Input VAT invoice a=
ttribution feed to be uploaded to Titan PI - China local automation - Confl=
uence</a> with only difference to include IC invoice as well.</p>
     <p>IC invoice must be interfaced after Titan SI booked successfully so=
 that internal invoice number can be updated to Titan SI when Titan PI appr=
oved.</p></td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <p>TMP</p></td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <p>27.R2</p></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">FR-22</td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <p><span style=3D"color:#000000;">Service Invoice filter</span></p></t=
d>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <p><span class=3D"inline-comment-marker" data-ref=3D"4a7f5733-8bdf-4c9=
e-9126-10c00d768793">Functional Line</span> should be mandatory for invoice=
s user confirmed to be booked</p>
     <p>IC invoice must be interfaced after Titan SI booked successfully so=
 that internal invoice number can be updated to Titan SI when Titan PI appr=
oved.</p>
     <p>Bank invoices: Attributed to Titan charges Trx</p>
     <p>non-Bank invoice &amp; WHT: Functional Line &lt;&gt;'Energy' &amp; =
User confirmed to be booked: Yes</p></td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
