    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">FR-27</td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <p><span class=3D"inline-comment-marker" data-ref=3D"0f84a441-a2f1-45f=
2-838e-b8b0fc843efd">Quantity FIFO Attribution</span></p></td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <p>Now in PI bulk uploader, Qty auto attribution is based on assignmen=
t quantity ratio, in Titan API, it should be based on FIFO logic, i.e. <spa=
n style=3D"color:#172b4d;">the system should allocate the Invoice Quantity =
in the FIFO Logic based on the Assignment Quantity instead of Assignment Qu=
antity Prorate </span><span style=3D"color:#172b4d;">and if any additional =
Quantity is left should be added to the last assignment.</span></p></td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <p>Titan PI</p>
     <p><a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"https://jira/browse/CCEP-189708"=
 data-issue-key=3D"CCEP-189708" rel=3D"nofollow">CCEP-189708</a></p></td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <p>27.R2</p></td>
