Td">FR-28</td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <p>Final Invoice Accrual clearance</p></td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <p><span style=3D"color:#172b4d;">The invoice amount auto attribution =
from Quota (RM &amp; Bulk FLs and Alumina under Concs. FL) to Assignment (F=
IFO to actualized assignments) will remain unchanged as per the Excel bulk =
uploader Section 8.4 on <a href=3D"https://confluence/spaces/CCE/pages/2517=
68588/FSD+-+Purchase+Invoice+and+Credit+Notes+uploader+for+China+VAT+Invoic=
es#FSDPurchaseInvoiceandCreditNotesuploaderforChinaVATInvoices-AutoAttribut=
ion" rel=3D"nofollow">FSD - Purchase Invoice and Credit Notes uploader for =
China VAT Invoices - CC&amp;E - Confluence</a>, with below enhancement is n=
eeded to clear previous provisional over-invoicing.</span></p>
     <p>During provisional quota to assignments allocation, any residual in=
voice amount will be temporarily allocated to the last actualized assignmen=
t. Once the Quota status is set to 'Final', Titan PI shall redistribute suc=
h residual amounts across all assignments according to the final quota allo=
cation, eliminating any over-invoicing and clearing all remaining accrual b=
alances.</p></td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <p>Titan PI</p></td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
     <p>27.R2</p></td>
   </tr>
