Td">
     <p><span style=3D"color:#f87168;"> <span style=3D"color:#172b4d;"><spa=
n class=3D"inline-comment-marker" data-ref=3D"52f10050-3f13-45dd-a043-84ce8=
613fcac">Bank VAT Invoice</span></span></span></p></td>
    <td style=3D"text-align: left;vertical-align: top;" class=3D"confluence=
Td">
