     <p>Note: If TO identifies mistake after Titan PI is booked and cancel =
attribution in TMP to re-attribute, TMP should warn user that the Titan PI =
is booked already and user need to tell TMP the new Titan PI No. after re-b=
ook in Titan PI since the same GT Invoice No. cannot be used to re-book in =
Titan PI due to unique key validation.</p></td>
