So when receives it in China international invoices from Titan PI, TMP shou=
ld not duplicate it under commercial invoices.&nbsp;</p>
     <p>Others will be categorized as Commercial invoices in TMP Input invo=
ices. Further sub-classification will be discussed later per Acct. further =
