     <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
      <p style=3D"text-align: left;">After WHT payment to local tax bureau,=
 the WHT payment receipt will be auto synchronized into TMP, when Acct. use=
r confirms it to be booked into Titan, TMP will call Titan PI API to book t=
he same in Titan PI with below cost code and deal ID.</p>
