<h2 data-nh-numbering=3D"6.2. " id=3D"FSDTMPInputVATAPIIntegrationwithTitan=
PI-ServiceVATinvoices&amp;WHTPaymentReceiptfromTMPtoTitanPI(27.R1)"><span c=
lass=3D"nh-number">6.2. </span>&nbsp;Service VAT invoices &amp; WHT Payment=
 Receipt from TMP to Titan PI (27.R1)</h2>
<p>Note: Service Invoice may flow from TMP with or without attribution, thu=
s Lines will be optional for service invoices.&nbsp; If with Attribution, T=
itan PI will auto approve the PI. If without Attribution, the Titan PI will=
 be booked in Incomplete status, and user will further attribute in Titan a=
nd manual approve it. Titan PI should control that the information from TMP=
 should not be editable to keep it aligned with TMP. Both pooled and non-po=
oled invoice are covered.</p><a name=3D"composition-deck-Dataextractionlogi=
c"></a>
<div id=3D"Dataextractionlogic" class=3D"aui-tabs
             horizontal-tabs
          composition-deck
          " history=3D"true" loopcards=3D"false" effecttype=3D"" effectdura=
tion=3D"1.0" nextafter=3D"0.0">
 <ul class=3D"tabs-menu
                            top
                    "></ul>
 <div class=3D"deck-cards tabs-pane active-pane" style=3D"">
  <p><b>Header</b></p>
  <div id=3D"-2137403731" class=3D"tabs-pane" style=3D"">
   <p><strong>Data level</strong>: Invoice Level. This table is per Invoice=
 level, one line for input VAT invoice.</p>
