    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Applicable</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><span style=3D"color:#172b4d;">CN203PI</span=
></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">CN: Domestic Purchase =E2=80=93 Standard Rat=
e for Service</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><span style=3D"color:#172b4d;">58231B9B81E44=
2B38D1A124381BDAD0F</span></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Special VAT issued by brokers is irrecoverab=
le, but such invoices are not booked in Titan, so no need to consider.</td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Special VAT</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">3%</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Applicable</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><span style=3D"color:#172b4d;">CN204PI</span=
></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">CN: Domestic Purchase =E2=80=93 Standard Rat=
e for Small Scale Tax Payer</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><span style=3D"color:#172b4d;">FBF120B8536D4=
95B8BB0D158AC434A13</span></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd"><br></td>
   </tr>
  </tbody>
 </table>
</div>
<h1 data-nh-numbering=3D"8. " id=3D"FSDTMPInputVATAPIIntegrationwithTitanPI=
-Non-functionalRequirement=EF=BC=8827.R1=EF=BC=89"><span class=3D"nh-number=
">8. </span>Non-functional Requirement =EF=BC=8827.R1=EF=BC=89</h1>
<p><span style=3D"color:#172b4d;">NFR is to capture all the non-functional =
processes and system related requirements for effective deployment and main=
tenance of the interfaces.</span></p>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
 <table class=3D"wrapped relative-table confluenceTable" style=3D"width: 10=
8.036%;">
  <colgroup>
   <col style=3D"width: 5.43689%;">
   <col style=3D"width: 11.6515%;">
   <col style=3D"width: 82.9126%;">
  </colgroup>
  <tbody>
   <tr>
    <th style=3D"text-align: center;" scope=3D"col" class=3D"confluenceTh">=
#</th>
    <th style=3D"text-align: center;" scope=3D"col" class=3D"confluenceTh">=
Type</th>
    <th style=3D"text-align: center;" scope=3D"col" class=3D"confluenceTh">=
Description</th>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>NFR-01</p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Performance</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>VAT invoice Volumes check Section 5 on page <a href=3D"https://conf=
luence/spaces/CCE/pages/286790477/Integration+Options+between+China+TMP+and=
+Titan+Purchase+Invoice+Sales+Invoice" rel=3D"nofollow">Integration Options=
 between China TMP and Titan Purchase Invoice &amp; Sales Invoice - CC&amp;=
E - Confluence</a>.</p>
     <p>China International PI volume: monthly average 270 cargo &amp; serv=
ice PI&amp;CN.</p>
     <p>The interface should support processing at least <span style=3D"col=
or:#f87168;"><span style=3D"color:#172b4d;">500</span> </span>VAT invoices =
per batch without performance degradation. The batch execution should be co=
mpleted within 1 hour under normal operating conditions.</p></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">NFR-02</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Error Handling and Retry</p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>The interface should provide automatic failure recovery mechanisms.=
 Failed interface transactions should be retried automatically every hour.<=
/p>
     <p>Users should be able to identify failed invoices and trigger resubm=
ission where applicable.</p></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">NFR-03</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Data Integrity</p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>The interface should ensure data accuracy and completeness througho=
ut the transmission process. No invoice records should be lost during trans=
mission.</p></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">NFR-04</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Reliability</p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>The interface should support once-and-only-once processing. Each in=
voice should be processed only once for a given interface transaction witho=
ut duplication.</p>
     <p>Reprocessing of failed invoices should not result in duplicate invo=
ices.</p></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">NFR-05</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Availability</p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>The interface should support normal business operations in China. P=
lanned maintenance windows should be communicated in advance. Temporary una=
vailability should not result in invoice data loss.</p></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">NFR-06</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Audit Trail</p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>For each interface transaction, the following information should be=
 logged:</p>
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"be355da3-4443-45fb-85e4-02e310afd0bc">Invoice Number=
</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"b1e960cd-924f-4d08-8464-f782a82fc054">Invoice Type</=
li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"7338711f-56f2-47dd-8609-3e35e5560829">Interface Exec=
ution Time</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"f77f893c-98dc-4cbf-acf4-85c123257191">Sending System=
</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"da39daa6-0b53-4bdb-8577-b02aec3db745">Receiving Syst=
em</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"a662ff49-2ee7-40cb-8791-e4d8f01a9efd">Interface Stat=
us</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"9e9010ec-52a6-434b-8fe6-7ade1126340f">Error Message =
(if applicable)</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"85fb7a5b-43e6-4f4d-b987-fbb60e181619">User who confi=
rmed the invoice for booking</li>
     </ul></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">NFR-07</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Monitoring and Alerting</p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>The interface should be actively monitored.</p>
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"8ee900c5-a5bc-4f22-b38e-e958d54b355a">Failed interfa=
ce executions should generate alerts to the support team in near real-time<=
/li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"a028cbb7-0084-427b-870d-44ff105b8aa2">Alerts should =
be raised to the support team if no invoices are successfully transmitted d=
uring a scheduled batch run.</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"ca69b789-35d1-492f-acc5-2eca8670d250">Alerts should =
be raised to the support team if invoices status is 'Sent' without final st=
atus of 'Approved' ,'Failed' or 'Cancelled' after <strong>5</strong> mins.<=
/li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"9e1f22c5-a63c-46ff-85c6-3c1bf42bc09a">Interface heal=
th status should be available for support teams.</li>
     </ul></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">NFR-08</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Security</p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>The interface should comply with enterprise security standards.</p>
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"dbbd307d-8480-48b2-8344-70830f9a041b">All API commun=
ications should use encrypted transport protocols.</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"8128d2f1-8375-45a8-a72f-fb2217acfcde">Only authorize=
d systems should be allowed to invoke the APIs.</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"e8919d25-c1cd-4308-9b0d-1bb8231219f0">Authentication=
 credentials should be securely managed and not stored in plain text.</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"c27731d1-bf04-47b1-b426-545eaf7c70c4">Financial and =
tax-related data should be protected during transmission and storage.</li>
     </ul></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">NFR-09</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>Scalability</p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>The solution should support future business growth.</p>
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"cc63bb30-5f38-47d4-a4b7-6c0dad582a74">The interface =
should support increasing invoice volumes without major redesign.</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"6ae2ab5d-c17b-46f5-ba54-51ec903f075e">Additional bus=
iness line and future China legal entities should be supported through conf=
iguration where feasible.</li>
     </ul></td>
   </tr>
  </tbody>
 </table>
</div>
<h1 data-nh-numbering=3D"9. " id=3D"FSDTMPInputVATAPIIntegrationwithTitanPI=
-Q&amp;A"><span class=3D"nh-number">9. </span>Q&amp;A</h1>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
 <table class=3D"relative-table wrapped confluenceTable" style=3D"width: 94=
.1112%;">
  <colgroup>
   <col style=3D"width: 2.86709%;">
   <col style=3D"width: 64.3671%;">
   <col style=3D"width: 32.7667%;">
  </colgroup>
  <tbody>
   <tr>
    <th scope=3D"col" class=3D"confluenceTh">#</th>
    <th scope=3D"col" class=3D"confluenceTh">Question</th>
    <th scope=3D"col" class=3D"confluenceTh">Answer</th>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">1</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p>What is the schedule of Oracle Acct. period switch? Considering bel=
ow scenario:</p>
     <p>1-Sep: TMP open new period of Sep, a new invoice with issuance date=
 of 1-Sep received in TMP and user complete attribution on 1-Sep.</p>
     <p>If Oracle side new period is not opened yet, Titan PI will receive =
failure from Oracle.</p>
     <p>If above scenario will happen, need to decide the API start timing =
for each month.</p></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Oracle new period is always open at the 1st =
day of a new month, so the scenario in this question will never happen.</td=
>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">2</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Any non-fiscal invoice (e.g. redistribution =
internal invoice) booked as commercial invoice in Titan needs to be exclude=
d when Titan interface commercial invoice to TMP? <span class=3D"inline-com=
ment-marker" data-ref=3D"66b177fb-cf72-4508-bfb3-aed43e45b0dd">What is the =
filter criterion</span>?</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Load all China international invoice into TM=
P, and categorization and filter will be done in TMP.</td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">3</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
      <p>Should Tax code for General VAT be booked as&nbsp;<span class=3D"i=
nline-comment-marker" data-ref=3D"d31583a0-4e7f-4a2f-83f4-290bd26f2c59">not=
 applicable</span> or applicable with 0%?</p>
      <p><span class=3D"confluence-embedded-file-wrapper confluence-embedde=
d-manual-size"><img class=3D"confluence-embedded-image" draggable=3D"false"=
 height=3D"65" src=3D"6c7ff9fe9ca9a7b2558218267a47557c2484f9964fff78486e45f=
c3c21ec42d4" data-image-src=3D"/download/attachments/296153961/image-2026-8=
-31_16-4-6.png?version=3D1&amp;modificationDate=3D1788163446000&amp;api=3Dv=
2" data-unresolved-comment-count=3D"0" data-linked-resource-id=3D"380031187=
" data-linked-resource-version=3D"1" data-linked-resource-type=3D"attachmen=
t" data-linked-resource-default-alias=3D"image-2026-8-31_16-4-6.png" data-b=
ase-url=3D"https://confluence" data-linked-resource-content-type=3D"image/p=
ng" data-linked-resource-container-id=3D"296153961" data-linked-resource-co=
ntainer-version=3D"100" tabindex=3D"0" alt=3D"" width=3D"468"></span></p>
      <p><br></p>
     </div></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p style=3D"text-align: left;">Invoice with IRR VAT will be mapped as =
Out of scope &amp; CN099PI (General VAT &amp; Broker special VAT, but broke=
r special VAT is not in Titan scope).</p>
     <p style=3D"text-align: left;">VAT Exempted-Applicable &amp; CN205PI</=
p></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">4</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
      <p>Whether users' access to book VAT PI in Titan should be blocked?</=
p>
     </div></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">No. <span class=3D"inline-comment-marker" da=
ta-ref=3D"4f3d03c0-e687-43b4-8713-bb8b15123e99">We should keep the access i=
n case there are issues in interfaces and user can still book PI in Titan</=
span>.</td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">5</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
      <p>Edge cases: Customs payment receipt not retrieved in CIS/TMP yet, =
but ST needs to make payment.</p>
      <p>Exceptional scenarios: When TMP is down or API does not work, user=
 need to initiate PI in Titan to make urgent payment.</p>
      <p>Option 1: Book prepayment to make urgent payment and then ZCF to C=
ustoms VAT when system recovered to avoid the risk of duplication while no =
additional IT effort.</p>
      <p><span class=3D"inline-comment-marker" data-ref=3D"c0aef4b0-8ba9-42=
f7-bd39-591e2f83f385">Option 2:</span> Book in Titan PI, then Titan PI send=
s to TMP Titan PI No. and CP. Invoice Reference\Invoice Description to TMP,=
 and TMP auto update the Input VAT when system recovered with Titan PI NO. =
to avoid duplicated booking. This make it messy and if user inputs wrong GT=
 VAT No., the auto linkage will fail and result in duplication.</p>
     </div></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
      <p>Edge cases not valid anymore based on our latest discussion becaus=
e customs VAT and duty invoices will be synchronzied from Titan PI to TMP <=
a href=3D"/download/attachments/296153961/RE_%20Follow%20up%20connect%20on%=
20Customs%20VAT%20in%20API.msg?version=3D1&amp;modificationDate=3D178972898=
4000&amp;api=3Dv2" data-linked-resource-id=3D"383894377" data-linked-resour=
ce-version=3D"1" data-linked-resource-type=3D"attachment" data-linked-resou=
rce-default-alias=3D"RE_ Follow up connect on Customs VAT in API.msg" data-=
linked-resource-content-type=3D"application/vnd.ms-outlook" data-linked-res=
ource-container-id=3D"296153961" data-linked-resource-container-version=3D"=
100">RE_ Follow up connect on Customs VAT in API.msg</a></p>
      <p>For exceptional scenarios, it should be handled specially instead =
of maintaining two-way interface for the same invoice type which will make =
systems unnecessarily complex. e.g. when book in Titan PI for VAT invoices,=
 user to inform the same to TMP to do data fix with Titan PI No. At month e=
nd, TMP can export a report to show the VAT invoices confirmed to be booked=
 without Titan PI No.</p>
     </div></td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">6</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
      <p><span class=3D"inline-comment-marker" data-ref=3D"a5a530fa-e643-4d=
83-871f-2c9211209df4">Do we still book the invoice qty in Titan? Can we tak=
e it in TMP as golden source is OK and no need to book in Titan &amp; Oracl=
e?</span></p>
     </div></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">For RM &amp; Bulk, it is needed in order to =
be mapped in S/N. For Concs, it is not required since TMP is element level =
qty while Titan is assignment level qty.</td>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">7</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">How to define invoice owner for Bank invoice=
s?</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Default as Amy Zhou.</td>
   </tr>
  </tbody>
 </table>
</div>
<h1 data-nh-numbering=3D"10. " id=3D"FSDTMPInputVATAPIIntegrationwithTitanP=
I-MeetingNotes"><span class=3D"nh-number">10. </span>Meeting Notes</h1>
<div class=3D"table-wrap">
 <table class=3D"relative-table wrapped confluenceTable" style=3D"width: 10=
3.564%;">
  <colgroup>
   <col style=3D"width: 9.31803%;">
   <col style=3D"width: 11.0061%;">
   <col style=3D"width: 42.2012%;">
   <col style=3D"width: 37.4747%;">
  </colgroup>
  <tbody>
   <tr>
    <th scope=3D"col" class=3D"confluenceTh">Date</th>
    <th scope=3D"col" class=3D"confluenceTh">Attendees</th>
    <th scope=3D"col" class=3D"confluenceTh">MoM</th>
    <th scope=3D"col" class=3D"confluenceTh">Actions</th>
   </tr>
   <tr>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <div class=3D"content-wrapper">
      <p><time datetime=3D"2026-09-23" class=3D"date-past">23 Sep 2026</tim=
e>&nbsp;</p>
     </div></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">Shilpa, Pratik, Prashant, Adyasha, Kevin, Ma=
rtin, Zoe</td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <p><strong>Release Plan</strong></p>
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"a9a62b96-607f-47b3-aa99-eb23194a7b63">The full integ=
ration scope is documented on the <strong><a href=3D"https://confluence/spa=
ces/CLA/pages/296153961/FSD-TMP+Input+VAT+API+Integration+with+Titan+PI" re=
l=3D"nofollow">page</a></strong>, and will be delivered in phases based on =
available team capacity.</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"ce21da92-dac1-4e93-b4af-332fb0f3cfef">Only the Servi=
ce PI integration from TMP to Titan PI is planned for delivery in 27.R1.</l=
i>
      <li data-uuid=3D"88048a04-de73-4f7e-be20-aff6e5eb9c43">All remaining =
integration scope is targeted for delivery in 27.R2.</li>
     </ul>
     <p><strong>API Design</strong></p>
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"e7e0c95e-44f7-4461-9f16-a70c0a8dd17c">Aligned on a R=
EST-based API architecture with real-time individual requests, validation c=
hecks, and processing responses.</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"9b09b053-0ce5-43a5-a170-c5746b43be4e">For China inte=
rnational invoices where the golden source remains in Titan PI and invoice =
data needs to be synchronized to TMP: TMP will invoke the Titan PI API at s=
cheduled intervals to get delta invoice data instead of synchronous API cal=
ls.</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"450e5d33-7aad-46bf-843d-1820f9262351">Cargo invoices=
, non-pooled service invoices, and pooled service invoices will be implemen=
ted as three separate APIs. TMP will invoke the relevant API based on the i=
nvoice type.----update: Pooled Purchase invoice to be covered in the 27.R1 =
in the same API, no need to do separate API.</li>
     </ul>
     <p><strong>Invoice Data Mapping</strong></p>
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"60fffd1b-b0ff-4865-a97e-1c6ffbec20a3">For data eleme=
nts that TMP already synchronizes from SRD, the corresponding GUIDs should =
be passed instead of names, including: GC, CP, Tax Code</li>
      <li data-uuid=3D"77b0524a-dd17-423f-811b-348b0be7f09e">Cost Code will=
 be passed as the Cost Code Name (e.g., C32P, C31).</li>
     </ul>
     <p><strong>Accounting Period</strong></p>
     <ul>
      <li data-uuid=3D"689a7bb1-e687-4a65-aa92-21f163c330c3">Titan PI does =
not maintain Accounting Period information and therefore cannot return this=
 field in its API response.</li>
     </ul></td>
    <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
     <div class=3D"table-wrap">
      <table class=3D"wrapped confluenceTable" style=3D"letter-spacing: 0.0=
px;" data-mce-resize=3D"false">
       <tbody class=3D"">
        <tr class=3D"">
         <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
          <p><strong>#</strong></p></td>
         <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
          <p><strong>Follow Up</strong></p></td>
         <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
          <p><strong>Owner</strong></p></td>
         <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
          <p><strong>Status</strong></p></td>
        </tr>
        <tr class=3D"">
         <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
          <p>1</p></td>
         <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
          <p>Split and complete invoice data mapping into different APIs</p=
></td>
         <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
          <p><a href=3D"mailto:zoe.zhang@trafigura.com" class=3D"external-l=
ink" rel=3D"nofollow">@Zoe Zhang</a></p></td>
         <td class=3D"highlight-grey confluenceTd" data-highlight-colour=3D=
"grey">
          <p title=3D"">Done</p></td>
        </tr>
        <tr class=3D"">
         <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
          <p>2</p></td>
         <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
          <p>Review the updated <strong><a href=3D"https://confluence/space=
s/CLA/pages/296153961/FSD-TMP+Input+VAT+API+Integration+with+Titan+PI" rel=
=3D"nofollow">page</a></strong>, identify any remaining open points, and si=
gn off the page.</p></td>
         <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
          <p><a href=3D"mailto:Shilpa.Bhansali@trafigura.com" class=3D"exte=
rnal-link" rel=3D"nofollow">@Shilpa Bhansali</a><a href=3D"mailto:Prashant.=
Banerjee@trafigura.com" class=3D"external-link" rel=3D"nofollow">@Prashant =
Banerjee</a></p></td>
         <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
          <p>Open</p></td>
        </tr>
        <tr class=3D"">
         <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
          <p>3</p></td>
         <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
          <p>Check with the GAI team how the Accounting Period can be obtai=
ned for each invoice.</p>
          <p><time datetime=3D"2026-09-28" class=3D"date-past">28 Sep 2026<=
/time> : Confirmed to get from Oracle.</p></td>
         <td class=3D"confluenceTd">
          <p><a href=3D"mailto:zoe.zhang@trafigura.com" class=3D"external-l=
ink" rel=3D"nofollow">@Zoe Zhang</a></p></td>
